  "case": "copy-fragment-preorder",
  "clause": "DESIGN R3.3 \u00a78.3 L657 copy returns a validated native fragment; harmonization B20 source document pre-order",
  "derivation": "Process_1 holds artifacts [Note_Z, Note_A] and flowElements [Task_1]. copy of [Note_A, Task_1, Note_Z] returns the elements in source document pre-order, not in UTF-16 ID order: the pre-order walks the canonical (profile-c14n/2) document, an element before its descendants, members in UTF-16 key order (artifacts before flowElements) and arrays by index, so the fragment is [Note_Z, Note_A, Task_1]. copy of [Task_1, Process_1] drops Task_1, which is contained in the requested Process_1, and returns the Process_1 subtree with property rootElements.",
